WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:09,567
It's relatively close to residential areas

2
00:00:09,567 --> 00:00:12,360
It's a convenience supermarket

3
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:17,630
So it’s not surprising that everything was robbed.

4
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:22,440
But no one goes to those big shopping malls in urban and suburban areas.

5
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:39,060
A shopping mall was just built two years ago

6
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:42,100
The nearest residential buildings are three kilometers away

7
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,300
Therefore, the probability of being sold out is relatively low.
